                            <p class="zr-assist__line">A scan pairs names by spelling, the model judges the pairs spelling cannot settle, and each proposal lands below as a tick. Nothing is written before Merge.</p>
                            <p class="zr-assist__facts">Last run 20 Sep · 275 pairs · 38k tokens · ~6 min</p>
                        </div>
                        <button class="zr-btn zr-btn--primary zr-btn--lg" type="button">Find duplicates</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="zr-runmeter">
                        <ol class="zr-steps">
                            <li class="zr-steps__step zr-steps__step--done"><span class="zr-steps__mark"><svg class="zr-icon zr-icon--sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons.svg#i-check"/></svg></span>Compare names</li>
                            <li class="zr-steps__step zr-steps__step--done"><span class="zr-steps__mark"><svg class="zr-icon zr-icon--sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons.svg#i-check"/></svg></span>Read documents</li>
