                        <p class="zr-runmeter__sentence">The model reads pairs of names with their evidence and says for each whether both mean the same thing, how sure it is, and why. 7 of 11 pairs so far were the same.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="zr-assist zr-assist--done">
                        <span class="zr-assist__icon"><svg class="zr-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons.svg#i-check"/></svg></span>
                        <div class="zr-assist__text">
                            <p class="zr-assist__headline">275 scanned · 34 merges proposed · 5 unsure</p>
                            <p class="zr-assist__cost"><span class="zr-tokenbar zr-tokenbar--mini"><span class="zr-tokenbar__track"><span class="zr-tokenbar__seg zr-tokenbar__seg--prompt" style="width: 70%"></span><span class="zr-tokenbar__seg zr-tokenbar__seg--answer" style="width: 20%"></span><span class="zr-tokenbar__seg zr-tokenbar__seg--thinking" style="width: 10%"></span></span></span><span>12 requests · 38k tokens · ~6 min</span></p>
                            <ul class="zr-assist__next">
                                <li>Every tick below is a proposal. Untick a group to keep its names apart.</li>
                                <li>"Merge" writes the ticked groups. "Not a duplicate" keeps a pair out of later scans.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="zr-assist__actions"><button class="zr-btn" type="button">Review 5 unsure one by one</button><button class="zr-btn zr-btn--primary" type="button">Merge 34 · 61 writes</button></div>
